# Source Servings: 8

::ingredients

(salad oil, olive or canola or sunflower) 1/3 cup
(cider vinegar) 1/2 cup
(salt) 1tsp
(pepper) 1/2tsp
(sugar) 1/4 cup
(celery seed) 1/2tsp
(green beans, cut) 1 can
(waxed beans, cut) 1 can
(kidney beans, red) 1 can
(carrot, thinly sliced) 1
(onion, small, chopped) 1
(bell pepper) 1

::equipment

(bowl, large, salad)
(colander)
(refrigerator)

::instructions

{dressing} = (salad oil) + (cider vinegar) + (salt) + (pepper) + (sugar) + (celery seed)
{dressing} <whisk, large salad bowl, blended>
(green beans) + (waxed beans) + (kidney beans) <empty, cans into colander>
    <rinse, cold water>
(carrot) + (onion) + (bell pepper) <chop, remaining vegetables as source states>
{salad} = {dressing} + (carrot) + (onion) + (bell pepper) + (green beans) + (waxed beans) + (kidney beans)
{salad} <stir, gently>
    <refrigerate, at least 1h before serving, stir occasionally>

::notes
Easy recipe to expand - black turtle beans and chickpeas also work well here.

